{"suttaId":"thag16.2","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Th","vriCode":"s0508m.mul","paras":[2910,2973],"vripara":"726"},"segments":{"thag16.2:0.4":"Pārāpariyattheragāthā","thag16.2:1.1":"“Samaṇassa ahu cintā, pārāpariyassa bhikkhuno;","thag16.2:1.3":"Ekakassa nisinnassa, pavivittassa jhāyino.","thag16.2:2.1":"“Kimānupubbaṃ puriso, kiṃ vataṃ kiṃ samācāraṃ;","thag16.2:2.3":"Attano kiccakārīssa, na ca kañci viheṭhaye.","thag16.2:3.1":"“Indriyāni manussānaṃ, hitāya ahitāya ca;","thag16.2:3.3":"Arakkhitāni ahitāya, rakkhitāni hitāya ca.","thag16.2:4.1":"“Indriyāneva sārakkhaṃ, indriyāni ca gopayaṃ;","thag16.2:4.3":"Attano kiccakārīssa, na ca kañci viheṭhaye.","thag16.2:5.1":"“Cakkhundriyaṃ ce rūpesu, gacchantaṃ anivārayaṃ;","thag16.2:5.3":"Anādīnavadassāvī, so dukkhā na hi muccati.","thag16.2:6.1":"“Sotindriyaṃ ce saddesu, gacchantaṃ anivārayaṃ;","thag16.2:6.3":"Anādīnavadassāvī, so dukkhā na hi muccati.","thag16.2:7.1":"“Anissaraṇadassāvī, gandhe ce paṭisevati;","thag16.2:7.3":"Na so muccati dukkhamhā, gandhesu adhimucchito.","thag16.2:8.1":"“Ambilaṃ madhuraggañca, tittakaggamanussaraṃ;","thag16.2:8.3":"Rasataṇhāya gadhito, hadayaṃ nāvabujjhati.","thag16.2:9.1":"“Subhānyappaṭikūlāni, phoṭṭhabbāni anussaraṃ;","thag16.2:9.3":"Ratto rāgādhikaraṇaṃ, vividhaṃ vindate dukhaṃ.","thag16.2:10.1":"“Manaṃ cetehi dhammehi, yo na sakkoti rakkhituṃ;","thag16.2:10.3":"Tato naṃ dukkhamanveti, sabbehetehi pañcahi.","thag16.2:11.1":"“Pubbalohitasampuṇṇaṃ, bahussa kuṇapassa ca;","thag16.2:11.3":"Naravīrakataṃ vagguṃ, samuggamiva cittitaṃ.","thag16.2:12.1":"“Kaṭukaṃ madhurassādaṃ, piyanibandhanaṃ dukhaṃ;","thag16.2:12.3":"Khuraṃva madhunā littaṃ, ullihaṃ nāvabujjhati.","thag16.2:13.1":"“Itthirūpe itthisare, phoṭṭhabbepi ca itthiyā;","thag16.2:13.3":"Itthigandhesu sāratto, vividhaṃ vindate dukhaṃ.","thag16.2:14.1":"“Itthisotāni sabbāni, sandanti pañca pañcasu;","thag16.2:14.3":"Tesamāvaraṇaṃ kātuṃ, yo sakkoti vīriyavā.","thag16.2:15.1":"“So atthavā so dhammaṭṭho, so dakkho so vicakkhaṇo;","thag16.2:15.3":"Kareyya ramamānopi, kiccaṃ dhammatthasaṃhitaṃ.","thag16.2:16.1":"“Atho sīdati saññuttaṃ, vajje kiccaṃ niratthakaṃ;","thag16.2:16.3":"‘Na taṃ kiccan’ti maññitvā, appamatto vicakkhaṇo.","thag16.2:17.1":"“Yañca atthena saññuttaṃ, yā ca dhammagatā rati;","thag16.2:17.3":"Taṃ samādāya vattetha, sā hi ve uttamā rati.","thag16.2:18.1":"“Uccāvacehupāyehi, paresamabhijigīsati;","thag16.2:18.3":"Hantvā vadhitvā atha socayitvā, ālopati sāhasā yo paresaṃ.","thag16.2:19.1":"“Tacchanto āṇiyā āṇiṃ, nihanti balavā yathā;","thag16.2:19.3":"Indriyānindriyeheva, nihanti kusalo tathā.","thag16.2:20.1":"“Saddhaṃ vīriyaṃ samādhiñca, satipaññañca bhāvayaṃ;","thag16.2:20.3":"Pañca pañcahi hantvāna, anīgho yāti brāhmaṇo.","thag16.2:21.1":"“So atthavā so dhammaṭṭho, katvā vākyānusāsaniṃ;","thag16.2:21.3":"Sabbena sabbaṃ buddhassa, so naro sukhamedhatī”ti.","thag16.2:21.5":"… Pārāpariyo thero …."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
